WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:04.600
Release notes eat an afternoon.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.333
Meet Shipnote.

3
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:11.500
It groups your commits and drafts the
changelog.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.533
Commits are grouped by their conventional
type.

5
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:19.067
Run the draft command in your repo.

6
00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:22.567
One command writes the changelog.

7
00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:23.200
Shipnote.

8
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.467
Release notes from your commits.
